LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$15 admission / 10pm doors / 10:30 start / standing / all ages 
 “Dark red from paint” is the exploration of unorthodox sounds in order
  to comprehend unintelligible feelings. This mix of alt rock groups bring 
 ethereal soundscapes and transgressive distortion to take the audience int
 o unnamed yet understood memories. This wide range of bands provide a spac
 e where everyone has a place. Through energetic and heartfelt music be rea
 dy for an ecstatic rock set into the night.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/
 home/2026/9/24/dark-red-from-paint\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.c
 ity/boston/
